{"id":"978522e3e7ee8e5c","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-stationary-increments.md","title":"Stationary Increments","display":"df-stationary-increments — Stationary Increments","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stationary-increments","aliases":["58-df-stationary-increments","Stationary Increments"],"display":"df-stationary-increments — Stationary Increments","depends_on":["[[58-df-stochastic-process]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stationary-increments"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stationary-increments</span><span>Stationary Increments</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stationary-increments — Stationary Increments"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"58-df-stochastic-process\">58-df-stochastic-process</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c8ba0e6355b38cd\" href=\"?note=5c8ba0e6355b38cd\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\ominus_E\\in V\">\\(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\ominus_E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{StochProc}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" href=\"?note=b5f77bed7dfe3f07\" title=\"58-df-stochastic-process\">58-df-stochastic-process</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5c8ba0e6355b38cd\" href=\"?note=5c8ba0e6355b38cd\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}increments}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\ominus_E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land I=[0,\\infty)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ominus_E,E\\times E,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\exists Y_{s,t},Y_s,\\nu_{s,t},\\nu_s\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(Y_{s,t},\\Omega,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Y_s,\\Omega,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(Y_{s,t}(\\xi)=\\ominus_E(\\langle X(t+s)(\\xi),X(t)(\\xi)\\rangle)\\land Y_s(\\xi)=\\ominus_E(\\langle X(s)(\\xi),X(0)(\\xi)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,Y_{s,t},\\nu_{s,t})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,Y_s,\\nu_s)\\land\\nu_{s,t}=\\nu_s\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}increments}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\ominus_E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land I=[0,\\infty)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ominus_E,E\\times E,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\exists Y_{s,t},Y_s,\\nu_{s,t},\\nu_s\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(Y_{s,t},\\Omega,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Y_s,\\Omega,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(Y_{s,t}(\\xi)=\\ominus_E(\\langle X(t+s)(\\xi),X(t)(\\xi)\\rangle)\\land Y_s(\\xi)=\\ominus_E(\\langle X(s)(\\xi),X(0)(\\xi)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,Y_{s,t},\\nu_{s,t})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,Y_s,\\nu_s)\\land\\nu_{s,t}=\\nu_s\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stationary increments mean that the law of an increment depends only on its length. The subtraction of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(0)\">\\(X(0)\\)</span> is necessary unless the process is separately normalized by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(0)=0\">\\(X(0)=0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>增量随机变量及其推前分布现由集合函数和七元分布谓词显式见证；不再依赖未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Law}_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\operatorname{Law}_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> 运算。</li>\n<li>Brownian motion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_t - B_s \\sim N(0, t-s)\">\\(B_t - B_s \\sim N(0, t-s)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Lévy process: independent + stationary increments</li>\n<li>Additive process: conditionally independent increments</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sato, Lévy Processes and Infinitely Divisible Distributions</li>\n<li>Applebaum, Lévy Processes and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-stochastic-process","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stochastic-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"5c8ba0e6355b38cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stochastic-process","status":"resolved","id":"b5f77bed7dfe3f07","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StochProc}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-stochastic-process]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"5c8ba0e6355b38cd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure3-distribution-of-random-variable.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\ominus_E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StochProc}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}increments}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{StationaryIncrements}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,\\ominus_E)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{StochProc}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\land I=[0,\\infty)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\ominus_E,E\\times E,E)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s,t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\exists Y_{s,t},Y_s,\\nu_{s,t},\\nu_s\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(Y_{s,t},\\Omega,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Y_s,\\Omega,E)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(Y_{s,t}(\\xi)=\\ominus_E(\\langle X(t+s)(\\xi),X(t)(\\xi)\\rangle)\\land Y_s(\\xi)=\\ominus_E(\\langle X(s)(\\xi),X(0)(\\xi)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,Y_{s,t},\\nu_{s,t})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3DistributionOfRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,Y_s,\\nu_s)\\land\\nu_{s,t}=\\nu_s\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X(0)","display":false},{"tex":"X(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Law}_{\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"B_t - B_s \\sim N(0, t-s)","display":false}],"bytes":2484,"backlinks":[{"id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-stationary-increments.md|58-df-stationary-increments]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["b5f77bed7dfe3f07","36d7463d215be751","5c8ba0e6355b38cd"]}